#: data/io.github.jackicus.Bookcase.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Bookcase keeps your e-books in one place and lets you read them. Add the "
"books you have, and it shows them as a shelf of covers, sorted into authors, "
"series and genres, with the book you are reading always one click away."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.Bookcase.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid ""
"Your files stay where you keep them: Bookcase reads a folder or a Calibre "
"library in place and never renames, moves or rewrites a book. Edits to "
"titles, series and covers live in its own library, and go with a copy when "
"you send a book to your e-reader."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.Bookcase.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "EPUB, Kobo EPUB, MOBI, AZW3, FB2, CBZ comics, PDF and plain text"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.Bookcase.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
